      "value": "@{5e4ca2145f9b3726b3b389e7|full_name}anatawa12: got it, thanks!\n\nWe're going ahead with making a new class that handles all of these interactions in the VRC.SDK3A.Editor assembly. The class added in beta.1 will be marked internal and used only for the final data storage. All of the interactions would need to go through `PerPlatformOverrides` class.\n\nThis also shortens the classname for the options to just `PerPlatformOverrides.Option`",
